# Page Layout Patterns

Every page in `src/pages/` follows the same structural hierarchy.

## Standard Page Structure
```jsx
export default function MyPage() {
  return (
    <div className="space-y-lg">           {/* 40px vertical gap between all sections */}

      {/* 1. Page Header — always first */}
      <div>
        <h1 className="text-headline-lg font-headline-lg text-on-background">Page Title</h1>
        <p className="text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2">One-line description of this view.</p>
      </div>

      {/* 2. KPI Strip — 2-4 metric cards, always second */}
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-md">
        <KpiCard />
      </div>

      {/* 3. Main Content — cards, tables, forms */}
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-md">
        <div className="lg:col-span-2">...</div>
        <div>...</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  )
}
```

## KPI Card
```jsx
<div className="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-xl p-md flex flex-col justify-between hover:shadow-sm transition-shadow">
  <div className="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
    <span className="text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">METRIC LABEL</span>
