</div>
```

## Data Card (table/list container)
```jsx
<div className="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
  {/* Card Header */}
  <div className="p-md border-b border-outline-variant flex items-center justify-between">
    <h3 className="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-on-background">Section Title</h3>
    <button className="text-body-sm text-secondary hover:underline">Action</button>
  </div>
  {/* Content */}
  <div className="p-md">...</div>
</div>
```

## Table Pattern
```jsx
<div className="overflow-x-auto">
  <table className="w-full">
    <thead>
      <tr className="border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low">
        {['Col A', 'Col B', 'Status', ''].map(h => (
          <th key={h} className="text-left px-4 py-3 text-label-md font-label-md text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider">{h}</th>
        ))}
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody className="divide-y divide-outline-variant">
      {items.map(item => (
        <tr key={item.id} className="hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors">
          <td className="px-4 py-3 text-body-sm text-on-background">{item.name}</td>
          <td className="px-4 py-3 text-data-tabular font-data-tabular text-on-surface">{item.value}</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
```

## Progress Bar
```jsx
<div className="h-2 w-full bg-surface-container rounded-full overflow-hidden">
  <div
    className="h-full rounded-full bg-secondary transition-all duration-500"
    style={{ width: `${pct}%` }}
  />
</div>
```
Color the fill semantically: `bg-emerald-600` (≥85%), `bg-amber-500` (75–84%), `bg-error` (<75%).

## Page-Level Action Button (top-right of header)
```jsx
<div className="flex items-start justify-between">
  <div>{/* title + description */}</div>
  <button className="bg-secondary hover:bg-on-secondary-fixed-variant text-on-secondary py-2 px-4 rounded-lg text-body-sm font-bold flex items-center gap-2 transition-colors shrink-0">
    <span className="material-symbols-outlined" style={{ fontSize: 16 }}>add</span>
    Primary Action
  </button>
</div>
```

## Detail Panel (sticky right column)
```jsx
<div className="sticky top-20">
  <div className="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
    <div className="p-md border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low">
      <h3 className="text-headline-sm font-headline-sm text-on-background">Detail Title</h3>
    </div>
    <div className="p-md">...</div>
    <div className="p-md border-t border-outline-variant flex gap-2">
      <button className="flex-1 bg-secondary ...">Primary</button>
      <button className="flex-1 border ...">Secondary</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```
